<title>LATVIA: Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most yields fell on Latvian Treasury bills at Wenesday's auction, with only the yield on one-month paper rising, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>All figures are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>MATURITY   ISSUE   BID   SOLD   YIELD (PCT) PREVIOUS YIELD (PCT)</p>
<p> One-month   0.75   0.29  0.29	10.07	   9.88</p>
<p> Three-month 1.0    1.43  1.0	 10.13	   10.21</p>
<p> Six-month   2.0    3.28  2.0	 11.44	   11.54</p>
<p> One-year    1.0    2.74  1.0	 12.80	   12.86</p>
<p>--Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
